Z||000001||SCCA FIERO||03-18-2000||09:39 PM||||On V6 cars it's located in front of the air cleaner(on the firewall). It's one of those black boxes(there are 2 of them) bolted to the firewall. I think the one you're looking for is the one closest to the outside of the car.<p>[This message has been edited by SCCA FIERO (edited 03-18-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||David||03-19-2000||02:20 PM||||On my '86 4 cyl it was on the firewall under the removable vent on the left side. ||||reg||1
