Z||000005||SCCA FIERO||03-19-2000||09:03 PM||||One word of advice: When you push the tank back up, make sure all the tabs are not pushed up between the tank and chassis. I got it bolted in and had one stuck and had to pull the tank down to get the tab.||||reg||1
